      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>While Cultist strangler grapple target(s)<br>the <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Bludgeon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7]{Grappled} target also<br><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Silence.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.Q8FTFPsXVpNj2zxT]{Silence}</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Suffocator"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When another creature is threatened by an </span><strong><span class=\"fontstyle2\">attack</span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">,</span><strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><strong>spell</strong>&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">or other&nbsp;</span><strong><span class=\"fontstyle2\">danger</span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, the Strangler may take their place (any Checks that are part of the danger will be performed against it; the Strangler may declare the use of this Skill </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><strong>before or after</strong>&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">the Checks have been made). If the danger already affected it, it affects it </span><strong><span class=\"fontstyle2\">twice&nbsp;</span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">(resolve both instances separately); the Strangler also cannot protect multiple creatures from the same danger. If the Strangler use this Skill during a conﬂict, it cannot use it again until the start of its next turn.</span></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Protect"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Cultist Strangler is vulnerable to all damage dealing by its grappled target.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Skin to Skin"
        }
      },
      "species": "HUMANOID",
      "spell_list": {},
      "stolen_check": false,
      "study_text": "<p>Cultist brute that expertises in wrestling, His hobby is to snuggling someone cute with his muscles.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>By the nature of strong person sometimes he just neglected the danger of his grappled victims.</p>\n<p>Or he might just letting them go so he can continue the wrestling match again?</p>",
      "subtype": "Sub-Type",
      "subtype_list": "HUMAN",
      "sword_ef": "100",
      "sword_vu": "NA",
      "tactic_notes": "<p>-ตัวจับสายเวท แนวหลัง</p>\n<p>-ถ้าเริ่มเทิร์นมาแล้วมีเป้าหมายถูกจับในมือ ใช้ท่าตรึงได้<br>-ตรึงเสร็จแล้วต่อย</p>",
